<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ site.siteName }}</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="#top" class="brandmark" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;">
      <img src="{{ site.crestNav }}" alt="{{ site.siteName }} crest" style="width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:50%;">
      {{ site.siteName | upper }}
    </a>

    <button
      class="mobile-menu-toggle"
      type="button"
      aria-label="Open navigation menu"
      aria-controls="main-nav-links"
      aria-expanded="false"
    >
      <span aria-hidden="true">☰</span>
    </button>

    <div class="navlinks" id="main-nav-links">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#whats-on">What's on</a>
      <a href="#membership">Membership</a>
      <a href="#price-list">Price list</a>
      <a href="#blog">Club News</a>
      <a href="#members-say">Members say</a>
      <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
      <a href="#host-events">Host your event</a>
      <a href="#club-standards">Club Standards</a>
      <a href="#find-us">Find us</a>
      <a href="{{ site.facebookUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12.06C22 6.5 17.52 2 12 2S2 6.5 2 12.06c0 5 3.66 9.15 8.44 9.94v-7.03H7.9v-2.91h2.54V9.85c0-2.5 1.49-3.89 3.77-3.89 1.09 0 2.24.2 2.24.2v2.46h-1.26c-1.24 0-1.63.77-1.63 1.56v1.88h2.78l-.44 2.91h-2.34V22c4.78-.79 8.44-4.94 8.44-9.94Z"/></svg>
        Facebook
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>
<header class="hero" id="top">
  <img class="rings" src="{{ site.crestHero }}" alt="{{ site.siteName }} crest">
  <div class="wrap">
   <div class="status-chip" role="status" aria-live="polite">
    <span class="status-dot"></span>
    <span id="clubOpenStatus">Checking opening hours...</span>
  </div>
  <h1>{{ site.heroHeadlineLine1 }}<br>{{ site.heroHeadlineLine2 }}</h1>

<p class="lede">{{ site.heroLede }}</p>

<p class="hero-location">
  <a
    href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Watlington+Sports+and+Social+Club+Church+Road+Watlington+Norfolk"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    aria-label="Find Watlington Sports and Social Club on Google Maps"
  >
    📍 <strong>Opposite the Village Hall</strong><br>
    Church Road, Watlington
  </a>
</p>

<p class="hero-welcome">
  Welcome to Watlington Sports &amp; Social Club —
  your friendly local club for coffee mornings,
  sport, entertainment and community events.
  Everyone is welcome!
</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
  <a href="#membership" class="btn btn-brass">Become a member</a>
  <a href="#upcomingEvents" class="btn btn-outline">What's On Next</a>
  <a href="#find-us" class="btn btn-outline">Find us</a>
</div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">About the club</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">{{ about.sectionTitle }}</h2>
        {% for p in about.paragraphs %}<p>{{ p }}</p>{% endfor %}
        <div class="featurette">
          {% for f in about.features %}<span>{{ f }}</span>{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <img class="dartboard" src="{{ site.crestHero }}" alt="{{ site.siteName }} crest">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="pin-rule">

<section id="whats-on">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">What's on</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Coming up at the club</h2>

    {% if whatsOn.regular.length %}
    <p class="eyebrow" style="font-size:13px; margin-top:26px;">Regular events</p>
    <div class="notice-list" style="margin-top:10px;">
      {% for e in whatsOn.regular %}
      <div class="notice">
        <div class="notice-date" style="background:none; padding:0;">
          <img src="{{ e.badge }}" alt="{{ e.title }} badge" onclick="openLightbox(this.src)" style="width:76px; height:76px; border-radius:50%; display:block; margin:0 auto 6px; border:2px solid var(--brass); cursor:zoom-in;">
          <div class="mon" style="color:var(--brass-dark);">{{ e.dateLabel }}</div>
        </div>
        <div><h3>{{ e.title }}</h3><p>{{ e.description }}</p></div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="upcoming-events" id="upcomingEvents" aria-live="polite">
      <p class="eyebrow upcoming-heading">Upcoming events</p>
      <div id="featuredEvent"></div>
      <div id="moreEvents" class="event-card-grid"></div>
      <p id="noUpcomingEvents" class="event-empty-message" hidden>No upcoming one-off events are currently listed. Please check back soon.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="membership" style="background:var(--paper-warm);">
  <div class="wrap">

    <p class="eyebrow">Membership</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Join Your Village Club</h2>

    <p>
      Become part of Watlington Sports &amp; Social Club and
      enjoy great benefits while supporting your local community.
    </p>

    <!-- Membership Benefits -->
    <div class="membership-benefits">

      <h3>Why become a member?</h3>

      <p>
        🍺 <strong>Discounted drinks</strong><br>
        Members enjoy reduced prices at the bar.
      </p>

      <p>
        🎉 <strong>Free event entry</strong><br>
        Members enjoy free admission to non-ticketed events.
      </p>

      <p>
        🤝 <strong>A welcoming community</strong><br>
        Meet friends, enjoy club activities and support
        your local village club.
      </p>

    </div>

    <!-- Membership Prices -->
    <h3>Membership Options</h3>

    <div class="membership-board">

      <div class="tally">
        <div class="kind">Single membership</div>
        <div class="price">{{ membership.single.price }}</div>
        <div class="note">{{ membership.single.note }}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="tally">
        <div class="kind">Family membership</div>
        <div class="price">{{ membership.family.price }}</div>
        <div class="note">{{ membership.family.note }}</div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <p>
      Membership is renewed annually. Fees are calculated
      pro rata for new members joining partway through
      the membership year.
    </p>

    <!-- Joining Instructions -->
    <div class="membership-steps">

  <h3>How to Join</h3>

   <p class="joining-intro">
    You can request a membership application form in person
    at the club, or request membership information online
    by following the steps below.
  </p>

  <ol>
        <li>Complete the membership enquiry form below.</li>
        <li>A committee member will contact you with
            an application form and joining instructions.</li>
        <li>Your application will be submitted for
            committee approval.</li>
        <li>Once approved, pay your membership fee
            at the club or by bank transfer.</li>
      </ol>

      <p>
        Membership applications are subject to committee
        approval, which is normally a formality.
      </p>

    </div>

    <!-- Membership Enquiry Form -->
    <div class="join-form">

      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:0;">
        Request Membership Information
      </p>

      <p style="font-size:14px; opacity:0.75; margin:6px 0 0;">
        Interested in joining? Complete the form below
        and a committee member will contact you with
        membership information and the next steps.
      </p>

      <form name="membership-enquiry"
            method="POST"
            data-netlify="true"
            netlify-honeypot="bot-field">

        <input type="hidden"
               name="form-name"
               value="membership-enquiry">

        <p style="display:none;">
          <label>
            Don't fill this in:
            <input name="bot-field">
          </label>
        </p>

        <label for="name">Full name</label>
        <input id="name"
               name="name"
               type="text"
               required>

        <label for="email">Email address</label>
        <input id="email"
               name="email"
               type="email"
               required>

        <label for="type">Membership type</label>

        <select id="type" name="type">
          <option>
            Single — {{ membership.single.price }}/year
          </option>
          <option>
            Family — {{ membership.family.price }}/year
          </option>
        </select>

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-brass">
          Request Membership Information
        </button>

      </form>

      <p class="form-note">
        Your details will be used to respond to your
        membership enquiry.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<hr class="pin-rule">

<section id="price-list">
  <div class="wrap">

    <p class="eyebrow">Price list</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">What we're pouring</h2>

    <!-- Members' Pricing Notice -->
    <div class="members-price-notice">

      <h3>🍺 Members' Bar Prices</h3>

      <p>
        All prices shown below are our discounted members'
        prices. Non-member prices vary by drink and are
        available at the bar.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Not a member yet?</strong>
        Join from just £24 per year and enjoy discounted drinks,
        free entry to non-ticketed events and more.
      </p>

      <a href="#membership" class="btn btn-brass">
        Become a Member
      </a>

    </div>

    <div class="price-categories">
      {% for cat in priceList.categories %}
      <div class="price-category">
        <h3>{{ cat.name }}</h3>
        <ul class="price-rows{% if cat.twoColumn %} two-col{% endif %}">
          {% for item in cat.items %}
          <li>
            <span class="price-name">
              {% if item.logo %}<img class="price-logo" src="{{ item.logo }}" alt="{{ item.name }} logo">{% endif %}
              {{ item.name }}{% if item.unit %}<span class="price-unit">{{ item.unit }}</span>{% endif %}
            </span>
            <span class="price-amt">{{ item.price }}</span>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="pin-rule">

<section id="blog" style="background:var(--paper-warm);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Club News</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Latest from the clubhouse</h2>

    <p style="font-size:15px; margin-top:14px;">
      {{ blog.intro }}
      <a href="{{ site.facebookUrl }}" target="_blank"
         rel="noopener" style="text-decoration:underline; font-weight:600;">
        Follow the club on Facebook
      </a>
      for day-to-day updates.
    </p>

    <!-- Category selection -->
    <div id="newsCategories" class="news-category-grid">

      <button type="button" class="news-category-card"
              data-category="Important Updates">
        <span class="news-category-icon">📢</span>
        <strong>Important Updates</strong>
        <span>Club announcements, facilities and important notices.</span>
        <span class="news-category-count"></span>
        <span class="news-category-action">View updates →</span>
      </button>

      <button type="button" class="news-category-card"
              data-category="Social &amp; Events">
        <span class="news-category-icon">🎉</span>
        <strong>Social &amp; Events</strong>
        <span>Entertainment, activities and event reports.</span>
        <span class="news-category-count"></span>
        <span class="news-category-action">View events →</span>
      </button>

      <button type="button" class="news-category-card"
              data-category="Club &amp; Community">
        <span class="news-category-icon">🏡</span>
        <strong>Club &amp; Community</strong>
        <span>Fundraising, volunteering and community news.</span>
        <span class="news-category-count"></span>
        <span class="news-category-action">View community news →</span>
      </button>

    </div>

    <!-- Selected category articles -->
    <div id="newsCategoryView" hidden>
      <button type="button" id="newsBackButton" class="news-back-button">
        ← Back to Club News
      </button>

      <h3 id="newsCategoryTitle"></h3>

      <div id="blogPosts">
        {% for post in blog.posts %}
        <details class="post"
                 data-category="{{ post.tag }}"
                 data-date="{{ post.date }}"
                 {% if post.open %}open{% endif %}>
          <summary>
            <div class="post-meta">{{ post.date }} · {{ post.tag }}</div>
            <h3>{{ post.title }} <span class="chev">+</span></h3>
            <p class="post-excerpt">{{ post.excerpt }}</p>
          </summary>
          <div class="post-body">
            {% if post.badge %}
            <img class="post-badge"
                 src="{{ post.badge }}"
                 alt="{{ post.title }}"
                 onclick="openLightbox(this.src)">
            {% endif %}
            {{ post.body }}
          </div>
        </details>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <p id="newsEmptyMessage" hidden>
        There are no articles in this category yet. Please check back soon.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="pin-rule">

<section id="members-say">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Members say</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">What people say about the club</h2>
    <div class="quotes" style="margin-top:22px;">
      {% for q in testimonials.quotes %}
      <div class="quote-card">
        <div class="quote-mark">&ldquo;</div>
        <p>{{ q.text }}</p>
        <div class="quote-name">— {{ q.name }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="testimonial-form">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:0;">Share your own</p>
      <p style="font-size:14px; opacity:0.75; margin:6px 0 0;">Submissions go to the committee for a quick check before they're added — not published automatically, so there's no spam risk.</p>
      <form name="testimonial-submission" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" style="margin-top:16px;">
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="testimonial-submission">
        <p style="display:none;"><label>Don't fill this in: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
        <label for="t-name">Your name</label>
        <input id="t-name" name="name" type="text" required>
        <label for="t-quote">Your comment</label>
        <input id="t-quote" name="quote" type="text" required>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-brass">Submit</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="pin-rule">

<section id="gallery" style="background:var(--paper-warm);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Gallery</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Life at the club</h2>
    <div class="gallery">
      {% for set in gallery.sets %}
      <div class="snap" style="background-image:url('{{ set.thumbnail }}'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; cursor:zoom-in;" onclick="openGallerySet({{ loop.index0 }}, 0)"></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="pin-rule">

<section id="host-events">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Host your event at the Club house</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Host your event</h2>
    <p style="margin-top:6px; color:var(--ink); opacity:.75;">{{ hostEvents.intro }}</p>

    <div class="event-tabs" id="eventTabs">
      <button class="event-tab" data-tab="babyShower" onclick="eventTab('babyShower', this)">Baby Shower</button>
      <button class="event-tab" data-tab="genderReveal" onclick="eventTab('genderReveal', this)">Gender Reveal</button>
      <button class="event-tab" data-tab="wedding" onclick="eventTab('wedding', this)">Wedding Reception</button>
    </div>

    <div class="event-panel" id="panel-babyShower">
      <div class="mem-slideshow" id="memSlideshow-babyShower">
        <div class="mem-frame">
          <img class="mem-img" src="" alt="">
          <button class="mem-nav mem-prev" aria-label="Previous photo" onclick="memMove(-1)">&#10094;</button>
          <button class="mem-nav mem-next" aria-label="Next photo" onclick="memMove(1)">&#10095;</button>
        </div>
        <p class="mem-caption"></p>
        <div class="mem-dots"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="event-empty" style="display:none;">
        <h3 style="font-size:16px;">No photos yet</h3>
        <p>Hosted a baby shower at the club? Send your photos over and we'll feature them here.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="event-panel" id="panel-genderReveal">
      <div class="mem-slideshow" id="memSlideshow-genderReveal">
        <div class="mem-frame">
          <img class="mem-img" src="" alt="">
          <button class="mem-nav mem-prev" aria-label="Previous photo" onclick="memMove(-1)">&#10094;</button>
          <button class="mem-nav mem-next" aria-label="Next photo" onclick="memMove(1)">&#10095;</button>
        </div>
        <p class="mem-caption"></p>
        <div class="mem-dots"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="event-empty" style="display:none;">
        <h3 style="font-size:16px;">No photos yet</h3>
        <p>Hosted a gender reveal at the club? Send your photos over and we'll feature them here.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="event-panel" id="panel-wedding">
      <div class="mem-slideshow" id="memSlideshow-wedding">
        <div class="mem-frame">
          <img class="mem-img" src="" alt="">
          <button class="mem-nav mem-prev" aria-label="Previous photo" onclick="memMove(-1)">&#10094;</button>
          <button class="mem-nav mem-next" aria-label="Next photo" onclick="memMove(1)">&#10095;</button>
        </div>
        <p class="mem-caption"></p>
        <div class="mem-dots"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="event-empty" style="display:none;">
        <h3 style="font-size:16px;">No photos yet</h3>
        <p>Hosted a wedding reception at the club? Send your photos over and we'll feature them here.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<!-- ==========================================
     CLUB STANDARDS & FEEDBACK
========================================== -->

<hr class="pin-rule">

<section id="club-standards" style="background:var(--paper-warm);">
  <div class="wrap">

    <p class="eyebrow">Club Standards &amp; Feedback</p>

    <h2 class="section-title">
      Respect our staff. Respect each other. Respect our club.
    </h2>

    <p class="standards-intro">
      Watlington Sports &amp; Social Club is committed to providing
      a safe, friendly and welcoming environment for everyone.

      Find out about our standards of behaviour, share your ideas
      or raise a concern with the club committee.
    </p>

    <!-- Three selection cards -->

    <div id="standardsCategories" class="standards-category-grid">

      <button type="button"
              class="standards-category-card"
              data-panel="conduct">

        <span class="standards-category-icon">📜</span>

        <strong>Code of Conduct</strong>

        <span>
          Read our club rules and standards for members,
          guests and visitors.
        </span>

        <span class="standards-category-action">
          Read Code of Conduct →
        </span>

      </button>

      <button type="button"
              class="standards-category-card"
              data-panel="suggestion">

        <span class="standards-category-icon">💬</span>

        <strong>Make a Suggestion</strong>

        <span>
          Have an idea to improve the club?
          We'd love to hear from you.
        </span>

        <span class="standards-category-action">
          Share your ideas →
        </span>

      </button>

      <button type="button"
              class="standards-category-card"
              data-panel="complaint">

        <span class="standards-category-icon">📩</span>

        <strong>Raise a Complaint</strong>

        <span>
          Raise a concern privately with authorised
          committee officers.
        </span>

        <span class="standards-category-action">
          Complaints information →
        </span>

      </button>

    </div>

    <!-- Selected content -->

    <div id="standardsContent" hidden>

      <button type="button"
              id="standardsBackButton"
              class="news-back-button">
        ← Back to Club Standards &amp; Feedback
      </button>

      <!-- Code of Conduct -->

      <div id="standards-conduct" class="standards-panel" hidden>

        <h3>Club Code of Conduct</h3>

        <p>
          Our club is committed to maintaining a welcoming,
          respectful and safe environment for everyone.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>
            Respect our staff. Respect each other.
            Respect our club.
          </strong>
        </p>

        <h4>Respect for Staff and Volunteers</h4>

        <p>
          The club operates a zero-tolerance policy towards
          abuse of staff, volunteers and committee members.
          Verbal abuse, threats, intimidation, bullying,
          harassment and aggressive behaviour will not
          be tolerated.
        </p>

        <h4>Respect for Members and Visitors</h4>

        <p>
          Everyone attending the club must treat others
          with courtesy, dignity and respect.
          Discrimination, harassment and threatening
          behaviour are unacceptable.
        </p>

        <h4>Illegal Drugs</h4>

        <p>
          <strong>
            The possession, use, supply or distribution
            of illegal drugs on club premises is strictly
            prohibited.
          </strong>
        </p>

        <p>
          Anyone found using illegal drugs on club premises
          will be subject to an immediate ban and the
          incident will be reported to the police.
          Any continuing exclusion will be handled in
          accordance with the club's constitution
          and applicable procedures.
        </p>

        <h4>Responsible Behaviour</h4>

        <p>
          Drunken, disorderly, threatening or aggressive
          behaviour will not be tolerated.
          Staff may refuse service where appropriate
          and in accordance with licensing requirements.
        </p>

        <h4>Club Property</h4>

        <p>
          Members and visitors must respect club property,
          equipment and facilities. Deliberate damage,
          theft or vandalism may result in disciplinary
          action or referral to the police.
        </p>

               <!-- SECTION 7 — CHILDREN, FAMILIES AND SAFEGUARDING -->

        <h4>7. Children, Families and Safeguarding</h4>

        <h4>7.1 Safeguarding Commitment</h4>

        <p>
          Watlington Sports &amp; Social Club is committed
          to providing a safe, welcoming and inclusive
          environment for children, young people and
          vulnerable adults.
        </p>

        <p>
          Safeguarding is a shared responsibility.
          All members, visitors, staff, volunteers and
          committee members are expected to act
          appropriately and help protect the welfare
          of others.
        </p>

        <h4>7.2 Parental and Guardian Responsibility</h4>

        <p>
          <strong>
            Parents and guardians remain wholly responsible
            for the supervision, safety and behaviour of
            children in their care whilst on club premises.
          </strong>
        </p>

        <p>
          Children must not be left unattended without
          appropriate supervision.
        </p>

        <h4>7.3 Appropriate Behaviour</h4>

        <p>
          All children, young people and vulnerable adults
          must be treated with dignity, kindness and respect.
        </p>

        <p>
          Bullying, harassment, intimidation, discrimination,
          abuse or inappropriate behaviour will not
          be tolerated.
        </p>

        <h4>7.4 Reporting Safeguarding Concerns</h4>

        <p>
          Any safeguarding concern, allegation or suspected
          inappropriate behaviour must be reported promptly
          to a member of club staff or an appropriate
          club committee officer.
        </p>

        <p>
          Where a concern involves a particular member of
          staff or committee officer, or reporting to that
          individual would be inappropriate, the matter
          should be raised with another member of staff
          or committee officer who is not involved.
        </p>

        <p>
          Safeguarding concerns will be taken seriously
          and addressed promptly. Where necessary,
          matters will be referred to the appropriate
          statutory authorities.
        </p>

        <h4>7.5 Confidentiality and Information Sharing</h4>

        <p>
          Safeguarding information will be handled
          sensitively and confidentially.
